# Palmface's tmux plugins, in load order: <GitHub repo> <pinned commit> <the file tmux runs>.
# The install's post script fetches exactly that commit into ~/.config/palmface/tmux/plugins/<name>
# and checks it (git rev-parse HEAD) before it is used; anything else is refused. load-plugins.sh
# runs them when tmux starts. The theme comes before continuum, so continuum's autosave keeps its
# status-bar hook. A new pin is a deliberate kit change (and a line in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).
rose-pine/tmux 39e39e76f6710b40a4b66222c6688ece1da8d3a4 rose-pine.tmux
tmux-plugins/tmux-resurrect cff343cf9e81983d3da0c8562b01616f12e8d548 resurrect.tmux
tmux-plugins/tmux-continuum 0698e8f4b17d6454c71bf5212895ec055c578da0 continuum.tmux
